{'symbol': 'ETR', 'date': '2022-01-28 14:02:00', 'title': 'ENTERGY CORPORATION ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT TO SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': "NEW ORLEANS, JAN. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE ENTERGY CORPORATION BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $1.01 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE MARCH 1, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF FEB. 11, 2022."}